flowchart TB
    U["No prior observation"] -->|Before-hook| Q["Requested<br/>Execution not established"]
    U -->|Result without start| F["Finished<br/>Outcome recorded separately"]
    Q -->|Execution established| R["Running"]
    Q -->|Result or explicit denial| F
    R -->|Terminal result| F
    Q -.->|Observation expires| S["Stale observation<br/>No terminal outcome inferred"]
    R -.->|Observation expires| S
    S -->|Correlated late result| F
